# Game Scripts

This folder contains the main gameplay scripts for Bogotá Explora Conmigo.

- `PlayerController.cs`: manages player movement.
- `FollowCamera.cs`: controls the camera following the player.
- `InteractableLandmark.cs`: handles interactions with landmarks.
- `CollectibleMemory.cs`: manages collectible memories.
- `UIManager.cs`: manages the user interface.

These scripts support the organization and implementation of the game's main features.
